，伊尹相商，呂望翊周，蕭張佐漢，咸播功化，光格四極。暨于繼體，咎單、傅說，祖己、樊仲，亦隆中興。或明揚側陋，或起自庶族，豈非尚德之舉，以臻斯美哉！曆觀近世，不能慕遠，溺於近情，多任後親，以致不靜。昔疏廣戒太子以舅氏為官屬，前世以為知禮。況朝廷何取于外戚，正復才均，尚當先其疏者，以明至公。漢世不用馮野王，即其事也。」表上，皆優詔敦譬。","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0270"]}],"rationale":"戒太子以舅氏為官屬的漢疏廣。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023","text":"祜女夫嘗勸祜「有所營置，令有歸戴者，可不美乎？」祜默然不應，退告諸子曰：「此可謂知其一不知其二。人臣樹私則背公，是大惑也。汝宜識吾此意。」嘗與從弟琇書曰：「既定邊事，當角巾東路，歸故里，為容棺之墟。以白士而居重位，何能不以盛滿受責乎！疏廣是吾師也。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"祜","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"女夫","kind":"person","person_id":"ntu_bz6_cgx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"祜","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"祜","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"諸子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023:m0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"汝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"琇","kind":"person","person_id":"9q8_4oi_lor","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p023:m0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"疏廣","kind":"person","person_id":"ia8_iqc_juv","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison","book_id":"b-jinshu-034","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-034-yanghu-ws256