d":116,"surface":"光武","kind":"person","person_id":"6c9_c43_555","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"漢二十四帝所列不重外戚者，明示漢代，不能接晉／魏同稱帝王。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"rdh_7yg_9xk","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"漢二十四帝所列不重外戚者，明示漢代，不能接晉／魏同稱帝王。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"穆叔","kind":"person","person_id":"18r_wn6_nhh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"不拜越禮之饗指魯穆叔；現役穆叔為昭公立時人物。此為有資格首選，事件本身另需平行原文覆核，不新增不拜事件。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0151","start":151,"end":152,"surface":"臣","kind":"pronoun","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","source_reference_owner":"jin035-contemporary-first-person","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。","source_voice":"peiwei_memorials"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"咎繇","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"謨虞指皋陶；現役主身份p3l與宋書引古p7b尚分號，本批不偷作跨來源同指。先列p3l為審查首選。","candidate_person_ids":["p3l_pp3_n6i","p7b_fs6_0uh"]},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"相商明定商代伊尹。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"呂望","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"翊周明定太公望；不把呂作現代姓氏補入名字。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"蕭","kind":"person","person_id":"xd8_uww_5ok","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"蕭張佐漢的蕭首選蕭何；與本單元收圖籍之蕭何一致。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0183","start":183,"end":184,"surface":"張","kind":"person","person_id":"ea5_zvr_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"蕭張佐漢的張暫解張良；與漢初開國輔佐典故相容，需保留複稱解讀資格，非泛指本篇張華。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"咎單","kind":"person","person_id":"0h0_68r_si5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"商代咎單，與咎繇不同；殷本紀現役原文有作明居及訓伊尹事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0205","start":205,"end":207,"surface":"傅說","kind":"person","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"商武丁輔臣，與咎單祖己並列中興，不拆說為語詞。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0208","start":208,"end":210,"surface":"祖己","kind":"person","person_id":"80h_7uw_251","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"商代祖己，與商中興敘述相容；不因己字接祖甲。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"樊仲","kind":"person","person_id":"x2u_81x_m6e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"首選周樊仲山父；現役三國志009亦以樊仲與吉甫對舉。registry保留與仲山甫候選未接合，本批不合drr與x2u。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0270","start":270,"end":272,"surface":"疏廣","kind":"person","person_id":"ia8_iqc_juv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"戒太子以舅氏為官屬的漢疏廣。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p019:m0319","start":319,"end":322,"surface":"馮野王","kind":"person","person_id":"py5_y2c_pxi","status":"source_explicit","narrative_qualification":{"kind":"historical_allusion","qualification":"裴頠表引漢世舊例，不是當時在場或任官。"}}],"source_position":{"first_line":56,"last_line":56,"revision_id":2506399,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/jin035-peixiu-peiwei/raw-projection.json","unit_key":"line056","raw_file_sha256":"b27aa9fc386b5f40990822d615febffcb8b8cd6df3fe6f74585274ff733c12be"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-034","source_id":"s-jinshu-034-yanghu-ws2567662-rendered-comparison","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷三十四〈羊祜傳〉","provide